[agent] I used the Hopsworks platform's **statistics engine** (via the `hops` CLI) to investigate drift — all computation ran platform-side, no local data work.
[agent] **Method (inspect → ingest → compute statistics):**
[agent] 1. Ingested the stream into feature groups and let the platform compute descriptive statistics (`hops fg stats`), which returns per-feature mean/stddev/min/max/percentiles.
